alIn}</span></div>`;html+=`<h3 style='margin-top:15px'>Outgoing edges</h3>`;consonant.forEach(j=>{const c=edgeCounts[v+','+j];html+=`<div class='stat'><span class='stat-label'>→ ${names[j]}</span><span class='stat-value'>${c}</span></div>`});html+=`<div style='margin-top:15px;padding:10px;background:#12122a;border-radius:8px;font-size:.85rem;color:#aaa'>${isPerfect?'<b>Bottleneck:</b> Only 1 self-loop (identity). Parallel motion forbidden.':'<b>Free:</b> All 12 self-loops permitted. No parallel restriction.'}</div>`;panel.innerHTML=html}canvas.addEventListener('click',e=>{const rect=canvas.getBoundingClientRect();const mx=e.clientX-rect.left,my=e.clientY-rect.top;let closest=null,minD=Infinity;consonant.forEach(v=>{const p=positions[v],d=Math.sqrt((mx-p.x)**2+(my-p.y)**2);if(d<35&&d<minD){minD=d;closest=v}});if(closest!==null){selected=closest;showInfo(closest)}else{selected=null;panel.innerHTML=\"<h3>Click a node to explore</h3><p style='color:#888;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5'>The voice-leading quiver has 6 vertices (consonant intervals) and 410 directed edges (permitted voice leadings).</p>\"}draw()});draw()</script></body></html>"
